WEBVTT

00:02.390 --> 00:06.660
<b><i>Within a clover's fourth 
leaf dwells good luck.</i></b>

00:07.790 --> 00:09.600
<b><i>Within a fifth leaf...</i></b>

00:09.600 --> 00:11.410
<b><i>resides a Devil.</i></b>

00:13.480 --> 00:15.090
<b><i>The Clover Kingdom.</i></b>

00:15.440 --> 00:17.430
<b><i>In this kingdom where Magic is everything,</i></b>

00:17.430 --> 00:19.330
<b><i>there is one boy who can't use Magic.</i></b>

00:19.330 --> 00:20.460
<b><i>His name is Asta.</i></b>

00:20.460 --> 00:25.380
<b><i>He puts in blood, sweat, and tears 
in hopes of becoming the Wizard King.</i></b>

00:25.750 --> 00:31.620
<b><i>One day, Asta obtained the power of 
Anti-Magic, which nullifies all Magic.</i></b>

00:32.200 --> 00:36.180
<b><i>Meanwhile, the Dark Triad,
the rulers of the Spade Kingdom,</i></b>

00:36.180 --> 00:39.120
<b><i>also possessed the powers of 
 Devils from the underworld,</i></b>

00:39.120 --> 00:41.940
<b><i>and began invading the other kingdoms.</i></b>

00:42.360 --> 00:44.700
<b><i>After a fierce battle, 
Asta and his friends</i></b>

00:44.700 --> 00:47.530
<b><i>defeated Dante, one of the Dark Triad,</i></b>

00:47.530 --> 00:50.850
<b><i>but then Magic Knight Squad 
Captains Yami and Vangeance,</i></b>

00:50.850 --> 00:53.580
<b><i>along with Queen Lolopechka, 
were kidnapped.</i></b>

00:53.940 --> 00:55.620
<b><i>In order to get them back,</i></b>

00:55.620 --> 00:58.860
<b><i>Asta tries to obtain the 
true power of his Devil.</i></b>

00:59.620 --> 01:03.590
<b><i>The Clover Kingdom's counterattack 
is about to begin.</i></b>

01:13.410 --> 01:16.810
<b>Spade Kingdom</b>

01:53.240 --> 01:56.480
<b>My elder brother's prognosis is looking good, right...</b>

01:58.030 --> 01:59.400
<b>...Moris?</b>

02:00.520 --> 02:05.580
<b>I played a key role in the 
Diamond Kingdom's sorcery studies.</b>

02:06.450 --> 02:09.490
<b>I'll heal him right up with no problems.</b>

02:09.840 --> 02:12.750
<b>So much so that he'll become even stronger.</b>

02:13.230 --> 02:14.830
<b>The Magic Power necessary for</b>

02:14.830 --> 02:18.000
<b>the ritual of the advent is being 
collected by the Candelo I created.</b>

02:18.000 --> 02:20.750
<b>A little trust, please?</b>

02:20.750 --> 02:24.260
<b>I was chased out of the kingdom 
because of that traitor Mars,</b>

02:24.510 --> 02:27.090
<b>but I ended up in a far 
more interesting place.</b>

02:27.090 --> 02:29.760
<b>I am grateful to all of you!</b>

02:34.480 --> 02:39.410
<b><i>Ah... I'm looking forward to 
fighting that kid again.</i></b>

02:40.100 --> 02:42.530
<b>No slip-ups with the other preparations?</b>

02:42.530 --> 02:44.550
<b>Everything's going pretty well.</b>

02:44.550 --> 02:46.800
<b>Isn't that right, Lotus?</b>

02:46.800 --> 02:47.820
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:48.420 --> 02:52.950
<b><i><i>This is... really bad... in a lot of ways.</i></i></b>

02:55.160 --> 02:57.410
<b>Clover Castle</b>

03:00.150 --> 03:02.350
<b>The Underworld where the Devils reside...</b>

03:02.350 --> 03:05.440
<b>The channel that connects us to it—
The Tree of Qliphoth.</b>

03:05.870 --> 03:10.180
<b>In order to create it, 
they need Yami and Vangeance.</b>

03:10.180 --> 03:13.540
<b>In three days, the gate to the 
underworld will be opened.</b>

03:14.490 --> 03:17.350
<b>Before that happens, we're going 
to take back Yami and Vangeance</b>

03:17.350 --> 03:19.690
<b>and destroy the Tree of Qliphoth.</b>

03:20.310 --> 03:22.610
<b>This time, we'll be the ones who attack.</b>

03:23.650 --> 03:27.620
<b>I'm the Wizard King, and yet... 
I'm powerless at a time like this.</b>

03:33.560 --> 03:35.450
<b>You are right.</b>

03:35.770 --> 03:39.460
<b>But that doesn't mean people who 
are right will always be rewarded.</b>

03:40.900 --> 03:42.290
<b>I'm up!</b>

03:43.220 --> 03:44.960
<b>So get stronger,</b>

03:46.500 --> 03:49.970
<b>to keep yourself from 
losing to unjust evil.</b>

03:59.140 --> 04:01.730
<b>DEVIL UNION
Mode: Canis</b>

04:03.230 --> 04:07.240
<b>From this point on,
what you call <i>training</i> begins in earnest.</b>

04:07.760 --> 04:09.170
<b>Both of you together...</b>

04:10.360 --> 04:13.270
<b>Try and defeat me.</b>

04:19.640 --> 04:22.270
Yofuke no okujō iki o nonde

04:19.640 --> 04:22.270
On the rooftop late at night, I held my breath,

04:22.270 --> 04:24.770
namae mo nai hikari o sagashita.

04:22.270 --> 04:24.770
and searched for a nameless light.

04:24.770 --> 04:27.730
Sekai no soto e tōzakaru hodo

04:24.770 --> 04:27.730
Beyond the edges of the world, the further away I drifted,

04:27.730 --> 04:30.280
kono mune dake ga sawai deta.

04:27.730 --> 04:30.280
the more my heart alone raced.

04:30.280 --> 04:33.110
Todokanai koto o shitteru kyori de

04:30.280 --> 04:33.110
It's at a distance I knew it would never reach.

04:33.110 --> 04:35.860
sore demo me o sorasenakatta.

04:33.110 --> 04:35.860
Still, I couldn't look away.

04:35.860 --> 04:38.120
Yume to genjitsu no sukima de

04:35.860 --> 04:38.120
Caught between dreams and reality,

04:38.120 --> 04:41.040
tachidomaru hodo kiyō janakatta.

04:38.120 --> 04:41.040
I wasn't skilled enough to simply stand still.

04:41.040 --> 04:43.130
Mō jūbun datte

04:41.040 --> 04:43.130
"That's enough,"

04:43.130 --> 04:46.000
dareka ga iu tabi

04:43.130 --> 04:46.000
Every time someone said that,

04:46.000 --> 04:51.250
owari no ichi ga zureteiku.

04:46.000 --> 04:51.250
the finish line shifted farther away.

04:51.250 --> 04:54.710
Akirame kata o shiranai mama

04:51.250 --> 04:54.710
Not knowing what giving up means

04:54.710 --> 04:57.050
koko made kita dakena nda.

04:54.710 --> 04:57.050
is the only reason I've made it this far.

04:57.050 --> 04:59.640
Mada mie tenai hoshi o

04:57.050 --> 04:59.640
Those stars that remain unseen,

04:59.640 --> 05:02.560
tsukamenai mama

04:59.640 --> 05:02.560
I'm still unable to grasp onto them.

05:02.560 --> 05:05.190
maketa yoru ni

05:02.560 --> 05:05.190
The weight of the night when I lost—

05:05.190 --> 05:07.780
kakaekonde iru.

05:05.190 --> 05:07.780
I'm left holding onto it.

05:07.780 --> 05:10.590
Kanawanakatta kazu dake

05:07.780 --> 05:10.590
For every unfulfilled dream,

05:10.590 --> 05:13.320
tashika ni nokoru.

05:10.590 --> 05:13.320
something real still remains.

05:13.320 --> 05:15.530
Kienakatta riyū ga

05:13.320 --> 05:15.530
The reason it never faded

05:15.530 --> 05:18.310
mune de matataite iru.

05:15.530 --> 05:18.310
flickers deep within my heart.

05:18.310 --> 05:20.950
Todokanakute mo

05:18.310 --> 05:20.950
Even if I can't reach,

05:20.950 --> 05:23.790
te o nobasu no o

05:20.950 --> 05:23.790
I'll still stretch out my hand.

05:23.790 --> 05:26.080
yamerinakatta sore dake de

05:23.790 --> 05:26.080
Never stopping is the only reason why

05:26.080 --> 05:28.920
mada owarenai.

05:26.080 --> 05:28.920
it's not over yet.

05:28.920 --> 05:31.840
Mukuwa renakute mo

05:28.920 --> 05:31.840
Even if it doesn't pay off,

05:31.840 --> 05:34.460
owara senakereba

05:31.840 --> 05:34.460
as long as I don't let it end,

05:34.460 --> 05:37.110
konosaki no monogatari wa

05:34.460 --> 05:37.110
the story that lies ahead

05:37.110 --> 05:38.130
make janai.

05:37.110 --> 05:38.130
is not one of defeat.

05:38.550 --> 05:44.000
<b>The Battle Begins</b>

05:38.550 --> 05:44.000
<b>page</b>

05:48.980 --> 05:51.650
<b>Asta, the only way you can become stronger</b>

05:51.650 --> 05:56.960
<b>is to fuse with that Devil and draw out 
100% of the power of Anti-Magic.</b>

06:00.090 --> 06:00.970
<b>A tail?</b>

06:11.310 --> 06:13.860
<b>Huh? Liebe disappeared?</b>

06:13.860 --> 06:15.280
<b>Here, I'm here!</b>

06:16.110 --> 06:17.990
<b>He got all tiny!</b>

06:17.990 --> 06:21.610
<b>Apparently this is what happens 
when I give you my power.</b>

06:21.850 --> 06:23.860
<b>In Devil-binding contracts,</b>

06:23.860 --> 06:26.910
<b>control belongs to the 
one giving the orders.</b>

06:26.910 --> 06:29.160
<b>In other words, the human.</b>

06:29.550 --> 06:33.130
<b>That's why I can easily unite easily.</b>

06:33.130 --> 06:35.740
<b>Your current condition isn't Union.</b>

06:35.740 --> 06:38.630
<b>It's just that Devil's power 
trickling into you.</b>

06:39.230 --> 06:41.760
<b>You said something similar, too, Liebe!</b>

06:41.760 --> 06:44.730
<b>How do I use your true power?</b>

06:44.730 --> 06:45.780
<b>I dunno.</b>

06:45.780 --> 06:46.560
<b>Huh?!</b>

06:47.150 --> 06:51.250
<b>I was trying to take over 
your body and fight.</b>

06:51.250 --> 06:53.920
<b>This is my first time fighting outside it.</b>

06:53.920 --> 06:56.320
<b>That's why I lost to the likes of you.</b>

06:56.850 --> 07:00.840
<b>You don't know anything! 
And you were all high-and-mighty!</b>

07:00.840 --> 07:03.760
<b>You're the one who formed this 
nonsensical contract with me!</b>

07:03.760 --> 07:04.940
<b>You figure this out!</b>

07:04.940 --> 07:07.030
<b>I have no idea, either!</b>

07:07.310 --> 07:08.540
<b>Clearly...</b>

07:08.870 --> 07:11.560
<b>you're going to have to figure 
that out as you fight.</b>

07:13.450 --> 07:15.400
<b>When I unite,</b>

07:15.400 --> 07:18.840
<b>I can add the characteristics of each 
of my Devils to my Shadow Magic.</b>

07:19.360 --> 07:21.480
<b>One of Gimodelo's characteristics is...</b>

07:22.830 --> 07:23.940
<b>Pack</b>

07:33.690 --> 07:37.800
<b><i><i>Each of these guys has the 
same ki as Vice Captain Nacht!</i></i></b>

07:39.270 --> 07:43.010
<b>The shadows won't disappear 
until you defeat me.</b>

07:44.690 --> 07:48.410
<b><i><i>He's fully blended in with them.
I can't tell where he is!</i></i></b>

07:49.370 --> 07:53.790
<b><i><i>Does this mean Vice Captain Nacht 
has contracts with four Devils?!</i></i></b>

07:53.790 --> 07:56.830
<b><i><i>He's been face-to-face 
with death that often?!</i></i></b>

07:56.830 --> 07:58.750
<b><i><i>Now that Liebe and I have a contract,</i></i></b>

07:58.750 --> 08:01.630
<b><i><i>our bond should be even 
stronger than before!</i></i></b>

08:01.630 --> 08:04.630
<b><i><i>I should be able to draw 
out more of his power!</i></i></b>

08:04.630 --> 08:07.680
<b>You formed a contract on 
equal terms with a Devil.</b>

08:07.680 --> 08:13.740
<b>Since he's not your servant, of course 
you can't immediately use all 100% of that power.</b>

08:14.100 --> 08:16.850
<b>You're the one who chose that path.</b>

08:18.500 --> 08:21.730
<b>Try and defeat me with that power.</b>

08:25.810 --> 08:26.490
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

08:30.900 --> 08:33.830
<b>Right here, right now, 
I'm going to surpass my limits.</b>

08:42.190 --> 08:43.340
<b>Demon-Slasher</b>

08:44.260 --> 08:47.850
<b>Your name is... the Demon-Slasher Katana!</b>

08:48.610 --> 08:50.950
<b>Let's go get Captain Yami together!</b>

08:50.950 --> 08:53.640
<b>By surpassing our limits, 
right here, right now!</b>

08:55.000 --> 08:57.390
<b>I hate that phrase.</b>

09:03.170 --> 09:07.490
<b>Thank you for seeing me 
through my training,</b>

09:07.490 --> 09:09.460
<b>Former Vice Captain Langris.</b>

09:09.460 --> 09:11.160
<b>The "Former" wasn't necessary.</b>

09:11.690 --> 09:14.660
<b>You're as mean as ever, I see.</b>

09:15.060 --> 09:16.890
<b>Not as mean as you.</b>

09:16.890 --> 09:20.790
<b>By the way, where's 
yappy little Ms. spirit?</b>

09:21.080 --> 09:24.550
<b>Bell won't come out of 
the Grimoire right now.</b>

09:24.980 --> 09:27.270
<b>This truly is unpleasant.</b>

09:31.130 --> 09:35.140
<b>To think you can do all this 
without the spirit's power.</b>

09:44.290 --> 09:46.570
<b>You two lost again.</b>

09:46.830 --> 09:50.350
<b><i><i>Vice Captain Nacht's super strong...</i></i></b>

09:50.350 --> 09:53.150
<b><i><i>No matter how many times I challenge 
him, I can't see a way to win.</i></i></b>

09:53.150 --> 09:56.260
<b><i><i>And yet... he probably 
isn't even serious yet.</i></i></b>

09:56.260 --> 09:59.580
<b><i><i>So this is the power of uniting...</i></i></b>

09:59.960 --> 10:03.330
<b><i><i>Why can't Liebe and I do the same thing?</i></i></b>

10:03.330 --> 10:07.590
<b><i><i>Even though the wounds from fighting in the black form, transfer to Liebe, too...</i></i></b>

10:14.100 --> 10:15.850
<b>Delicious!</b>

10:15.850 --> 10:18.760
<b>And my wounds and stamina are recovering!</b>

10:18.760 --> 10:22.500
<b>What are the snacks made with the Spade 
Kingdom's resistance's magic called again?</b>

10:22.500 --> 10:24.610
<b>I need to thank them when I see them!</b>

10:25.120 --> 10:27.650
<b>Oh! Eating something 
sweet gave me an idea!</b>

10:27.650 --> 10:29.110
<b>Come with me for a bit, Liebe!</b>

10:29.880 --> 10:33.180
<b><i><i>When he gets like this, 
about 10% of the time,</i></i></b>

10:33.180 --> 10:35.740
<b><i><i>whatever he comes up with is genius...</i></i></b>

10:38.370 --> 10:40.820
<b>Combine!</b>

10:41.160 --> 10:44.080
<b><i><i>Typically, 90% of it is pure nonsense, though.</i></i></b>

10:44.080 --> 10:47.210
<b>We don't have time to mess 
around, you 90% idiot!</b>

10:47.210 --> 10:49.030
<b>I'm <i>not</i> messing around!</b>

10:49.030 --> 10:52.720
<b>If we fight like this, our hearts and 
bodies will become even more as one!</b>

10:53.460 --> 10:56.860
<b>Don't you get tired of being 
such a goody-two-shoes?</b>

10:57.610 --> 11:00.640
<b>Don't <i>you</i> get tired of 
being so free, Big Brother?</b>

11:00.640 --> 11:05.150
<b>You idiot. What's so 
tiring about being free?</b>

11:05.150 --> 11:08.560
<b>If we could become one like this, 
we'd have no problems, you 90% idiot!</b>

11:08.560 --> 11:11.220
<b>What'd you say?! You get to 
be on top, so stop complaining!</b>

11:11.220 --> 11:13.410
<b>It's about time to meet up with the rest.</b>

11:13.410 --> 11:18.410
<b>Huh? It's already been two days?! 
I didn't even notice! Oh, crap!</b>

11:18.410 --> 11:20.090
<b>I guess there's no other choice.</b>

11:23.360 --> 11:26.600
<b>If it's not going to work out anyway, 
then die here.</b>

11:28.630 --> 11:29.960
<b>Liebe!</b>

11:29.960 --> 11:31.080
<b>MANA ZONE</b>

11:31.080 --> 11:32.970
<b>Dark Prison Hunting Ground</b>

11:37.970 --> 11:39.470
<b><i><i>It's pitch dark...</i></i></b>

11:42.290 --> 11:43.480
<b><i><i>This is...</i></i></b>

11:45.940 --> 11:51.320
<b><i><i>Their ki... I can't sense anything! 
I have no way of dodging these attacks!</i></i></b>

11:52.210 --> 11:55.200
<b>You showed such potential. What a shame.</b>

11:55.480 --> 11:58.950
<b><i><i>From darkness where I can't feel 
anything to creeping death...</i></i></b>

11:58.950 --> 12:01.950
<b><i><i>This is... true fear!</i></i></b>

12:07.950 --> 12:09.480
<b><i><i>Damn it!</i></i></b>

12:09.480 --> 12:12.050
<b><i><i>Why won't it work when 
we're this cornered?!</i></i></b>

12:12.530 --> 12:17.050
<b><i><i>Asta and I should both feel the same. 
We both want more power!</i></i></b>

12:17.730 --> 12:22.680
<b><i><i>So why? Why can't we unite?!</i></i></b>

12:22.970 --> 12:25.940
<b><i><i>To save Captain Yami...</i></i></b>

12:26.450 --> 12:29.740
<b><i><i>To avenge Licita...</i></i></b>

12:31.110 --> 12:33.660
<b><i><i>I can't afford to die!</i></i></b>

12:33.660 --> 12:34.990
<b><i><i>And...</i></i></b>

12:34.990 --> 12:37.980
<b><i><i>I can't let him die, either!</i></i></b>

13:11.060 --> 13:14.320
<b><i><i>He made sure he didn't hit me directly.</i></i></b>

13:14.550 --> 13:18.570
<b><i><i>He didn't even touch me, but the 
Union in my arm came undone.</i></i></b>

13:18.570 --> 13:23.580
<b><i><i>He also erased my Magic, which has no 
substance, along with the Mana Zone.</i></i></b>

13:23.870 --> 13:25.390
<b><i><i>Anti-Magic...</i></i></b>

13:25.390 --> 13:28.040
<b><i><i>If he used it at full power, he'd be...</i></i></b>

13:30.390 --> 13:31.990
<b><i><i>the strongest.</i></i></b>

13:31.990 --> 13:33.550
<b>I lose.</b>

13:33.930 --> 13:36.760
<b>Heck yeah! So let's get going, quick!</b>

13:37.000 --> 13:37.860
<b>No.</b>

13:37.860 --> 13:41.640
<b>B-But why?! Liebe and I 
pulled off Devil Union!</b>

13:41.640 --> 13:46.870
<b>Only for an instant. 
Not to mention you hadn't united completely, anyway.</b>

13:47.520 --> 13:51.070
<b>You should know that yourself. Am I wrong?</b>

13:52.320 --> 13:56.030
<b><i><i>He's right. But we came this far!</i></i></b>

13:56.030 --> 13:58.560
<b>If you go into enemy 
territory in this state,</b>

13:58.560 --> 14:01.040
<b>you'll only die in the end.</b>

14:01.040 --> 14:01.910
<b>But I—</b>

14:01.910 --> 14:04.160
<b>Using my Shadow Magic...</b>

14:04.160 --> 14:06.630
<b>I watched you and 
the other Black Bulls.</b>

14:06.630 --> 14:07.660
<b>What?</b>

14:07.950 --> 14:12.570
<b>You were born without magic, 
accidentally became host to a Devil,</b>

14:12.570 --> 14:15.170
<b>and were toyed with by a cruel fate.</b>

14:15.600 --> 14:16.920
<b>But...</b>

14:18.950 --> 14:21.190
<b>you were always right.</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:27.070
<b>I said, "That doesn't mean people who 
are right will always be rewarded."</b>

14:27.070 --> 14:28.350
<b>But...</b>

14:28.750 --> 14:32.350
<b>I <i>want</i> those who are right to be rewarded.</b>

14:33.090 --> 14:34.650
<b>Vice Captain Nacht...</b>

14:37.860 --> 14:39.320
<b>I'll leave Gimodelo here.</b>

14:39.550 --> 14:41.600
<b>What?! Uh...</b>

14:41.600 --> 14:44.570
<b>We'll do everything we can 
until you can join us.</b>

14:45.510 --> 14:47.530
<b>So polish yourself up 
as much as you can...</b>

14:48.960 --> 14:50.340
<b>and come join us.</b>

14:51.770 --> 14:52.790
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

14:53.460 --> 14:56.710
<b>I'm gonna die if I get hit by that!</b>

14:56.710 --> 14:59.080
<b>Master Nacht is an ogre!</b>

15:00.810 --> 15:03.890
<b>Pleasure working with ya, Gimodelo!</b>

15:04.240 --> 15:08.280
<b><i><i>Th-They're definitely out to kill me!</i></i></b>

15:35.060 --> 15:37.610
<b>Okay, let's go!</b>

15:38.960 --> 15:41.890
<b>Looks like you're all here. Are you ready?</b>

15:41.890 --> 15:43.810
<b>Crimson Lion Kings Captain
Fuegoleon Vermillion</b>

15:42.320 --> 15:43.810
<b>Where's Asta?</b>

15:43.810 --> 15:46.390
<b>Aqua Deer Captain
Rill Boismortier</b>

15:44.130 --> 15:46.390
<b>He's going to need a little more time.</b>

15:46.390 --> 15:50.190
<b>Green Praying Mantises Captain
Jack the Ripper</b>

15:46.390 --> 15:50.190
<b>Green Praying Mantises
Sekke Bronzazza</b>

15:47.140 --> 15:50.190
<b>Not like I'm counting on him anyway!</b>

15:50.190 --> 15:52.940
<b>Blue Rose Knights Captain
Charlotte Roselei</b>

15:50.190 --> 15:52.940
<b>Huh? Asta's not coming?</b>

15:52.940 --> 15:58.030
<b>Well, whatever. We're probably gonna 
see something super fun real soon!</b>

15:52.940 --> 15:58.030
<b>Sally</b>

15:52.940 --> 15:58.030
<b>Valtos</b>

15:52.940 --> 15:58.030
<b>Rades Spirito</b>

15:58.030 --> 16:00.450
<b>Maybe I'll get to test out the magic items</b>

15:58.030 --> 16:00.450
<b>Coral Peacocks Captain
Dorothy Unsworth</b>

16:00.450 --> 16:03.370
<b>I made from researching Asta's body!</b>

16:00.450 --> 16:03.370
<b>Golden Dawn
Langris Vaude</b>

16:03.370 --> 16:07.660
<b>Silver Eagles Captain
Nozel Silva</b>

16:03.630 --> 16:07.660
<b>These robes... I heard <i>she</i> made them. 
Are they really okay?</b>

16:07.660 --> 16:12.170
<b>Makusa North</b>

16:07.970 --> 16:12.170
<b>Ms. Sally's a bit weird,
but when it comes to magic item research,</b>

16:12.170 --> 16:13.110
<b>she's the best!</b>

16:12.170 --> 16:14.420
<b>Ralph Niaflem</b>

16:13.110 --> 16:14.420
<b>Don't worry.</b>

16:14.420 --> 16:18.260
<b>Makusa! Don't butt in just because 
magic items were mentioned!</b>

16:18.260 --> 16:20.480
<b>Oh, look, Mr. Rades!</b>

16:20.480 --> 16:24.390
<b>You wouldn't believe it, but these robes 
have the ability to conceal Magic Power!</b>

16:24.390 --> 16:27.600
<b>Just as Ms. Sally said, after 
researching Asta's Anti-Magic,</b>

16:27.600 --> 16:29.920
<b>we were able to create this amazing...</b>

16:28.810 --> 16:31.000
<b>—Just shut up already!</b>

16:29.920 --> 16:29.920
<b>—Magic is so deep.</b>

16:29.920 --> 16:31.000
<b>—Good grief.</b>

16:31.000 --> 16:33.150
<b><i>—Wh-Wh...</i></b>

16:33.620 --> 16:37.020
<b><i><i>Why do I have to participate in this 
insanely crazy Demon-mode level mission</i></i></b>

16:37.020 --> 16:39.780
<b><i><i>surrounded by all these insane guys?!</i></i></b>

16:40.430 --> 16:43.430
<b><i><i>I mean, I did live it up 
these past six months, but...</i></i></b>

16:43.430 --> 16:44.490
<b>Bah-ha!</b>

16:44.930 --> 16:51.300
<b>Sekke! Show those captains 
just what you're made of!</b>

16:51.300 --> 16:52.490
<b>Bah-ha!</b>

16:52.490 --> 16:56.800
<b><i><i>No one told me we'd be 
going straight into hell!</i></i></b>

16:57.050 --> 17:02.760
<b>I don't know why the hell you're here, 
but you'd better give it your all.</b>

17:04.890 --> 17:07.720
<b>Sacrifice yourself for the righteous.</b>

17:07.720 --> 17:09.310
<b>Huh?!</b>

17:09.560 --> 17:11.760
<b>Will Asta really make it in time?</b>

17:11.760 --> 17:13.180
<b>He will <i>definitely</i> come.</b>

17:13.810 --> 17:17.570
<b>Golden Dawn Vice Captain
Yuno</b>

17:14.110 --> 17:17.570
<b>Though I'll take care of 
everything before he shows up.</b>

17:18.730 --> 17:20.570
<b>Not you! That'll be me!</b>

17:20.880 --> 17:22.570
<b>Not you, either.</b>

17:22.570 --> 17:25.140
<b>Shadow Magic: Shadow Corridor</b>

17:30.330 --> 17:31.630
<b>It'll be us.</b>

17:37.880 --> 17:38.960
<b>Oh my?</b>

17:39.190 --> 17:41.130
<b>Looks like they're here.</b>

17:41.700 --> 17:43.190
<b>The Resistance!</b>

17:44.870 --> 17:48.310
<b>Hear me, Dark Triad!</b>

17:48.310 --> 17:51.850
<b>Seventeen years ago, you 
murdered our king, Lord Loyce,</b>

17:51.850 --> 17:53.810
<b>and many of our brethren!</b>

17:54.020 --> 17:58.320
<b>And since then, you've committed 
heinous crimes against our citizens!</b>

17:58.520 --> 18:01.100
<b>You will never be forgiven!</b>

18:02.020 --> 18:06.980
<b><i><i>We know that if we fought 
you to the death, we'd lose.</i></i></b>

18:06.980 --> 18:08.600
<b><i><i>But even so...</i></i></b>

18:09.680 --> 18:18.090
<b>We, the citizens of the Spade Kingdom, 
will never accept you as our rulers!</b>

18:20.840 --> 18:23.220
<b>All right. Everyone, follow the plan.</b>

18:25.690 --> 18:29.170
<b>So you were undercover 
in the Spade Kingdom,</b>

18:29.170 --> 18:33.020
<b>and you'd been in contact with the 
resistance ever since I left the kingdom?</b>

18:33.020 --> 18:37.870
<b>Yes. I didn't intend to get so 
involved with the resistance.</b>

18:37.870 --> 18:42.780
<b>But seeing your abilities and actions, 
I thought it'd be better if I helped out.</b>

18:43.240 --> 18:48.790
<b>I saw your resolve at the meeting. 
Sorry I pretended I didn't know.</b>

18:48.790 --> 18:50.270
<b>No way!</b>

18:51.090 --> 18:55.640
<b><i><i>I implore you, Sir Nacht! 
The Clover Kingdom's greatest mages!</i></i></b>

18:55.640 --> 18:57.710
<b><i><i>And... Lord Yuno!</i></i></b>

18:58.170 --> 19:02.210
<b><i><i>We'll create a diversion for you 
even if it costs us our lives!</i></i></b>

19:07.620 --> 19:09.910
<b>What's this quaking?!</b>

19:20.250 --> 19:21.440
<b>This is...</b>

19:21.440 --> 19:24.280
<b>the legendary ancient Demon?!</b>

19:25.120 --> 19:27.930
<b>When faced with overwhelming power,</b>

19:27.930 --> 19:31.530
<b>feelings and persistence mean nothing.</b>

19:32.150 --> 19:34.790
<b>Since a rat managed to sneak in,</b>

19:35.320 --> 19:38.290
<b>With the Qliphoth advent ritual
underway, we knew the resistance</b>

19:38.290 --> 19:41.040
<b>would try <i>something</i>...</b>

19:41.370 --> 19:44.760
<b>but I didn't expect them 
to come at us head-on.</b>

19:45.300 --> 19:47.880
<b>We were planning to use the Demon to</b>

19:47.880 --> 19:50.890
<b>exterminate all the people 
in the castle town.</b>

19:52.760 --> 19:55.890
<b>You're not citizens of the Spade Kingdom.</b>

19:56.330 --> 20:00.560
<b>Only we, the strong, are 
citizens of the Spade Kingdom.</b>

20:00.560 --> 20:04.090
<b>Let the Qliphoth advent ritual begin.</b>

20:07.830 --> 20:09.180
<b>This sound...</b>

20:09.180 --> 20:11.100
<b>Such intense Magic Power!</b>

20:11.100 --> 20:13.160
<b>Are the ones outside all right?!</b>

20:13.350 --> 20:14.660
<b>They're fine.</b>

20:34.080 --> 20:36.770
<b>You all! That was some good howling!</b>

20:37.020 --> 20:42.350
<b>I, Mereoleona Vermillion, a Clover Kingdom Royal, will lend you a hand!</b>

20:45.670 --> 20:50.540
<b>The advent ritual is a giant magic circle 
that's powered by four functions.</b>

20:51.200 --> 20:54.700
<b>First is the site of the advent 
of Qliphoth in the center.</b>

20:55.130 --> 20:59.540
<b>At the other three spots the ones who will activate the ritual await. The Dark Triad.</b>

21:00.530 --> 21:03.150
<b>We'll defeat all three 
members of the Triad</b>

21:03.150 --> 21:05.340
<b>and make it so the ritual can't operate.</b>

21:05.510 --> 21:08.430
<b>Then the advent of the 
Qliphoth will be stopped,</b>

21:08.430 --> 21:10.340
<b>and we'll prevent the gate from opening.</b>

21:10.600 --> 21:14.550
<b>Another plan is to use Anti-Magic 
to destroy the Qliphoth itself.</b>

21:14.550 --> 21:16.870
<b>But it's not guaranteed to work.</b>

21:17.560 --> 21:21.520
<b>And if we did forcefully destroy 
it and Yami or Vangeance died,</b>

21:21.520 --> 21:23.350
<b>you all wouldn't forgive me, would you?</b>

21:24.030 --> 21:27.170
<b>The Triad is in three different spots 
on the perimeter of the magic circle.</b>

21:27.670 --> 21:31.610
<b>So we'll split into three groups, 
attack the Triad together, and crush them.</b>

21:32.430 --> 21:34.620
<b>Even if there's a diversion 
outside the castle,</b>

21:34.620 --> 21:37.700
<b>you'll probably run into 
some Dark Disciples.</b>

21:37.700 --> 21:39.250
<b>Intruders!</b>

21:39.250 --> 21:43.460
<b>When you do, someone can 
act as a decoy and go wild.</b>

21:48.010 --> 21:49.710
<b>To take them down for good,</b>

21:49.980 --> 21:53.450
<b>we'll send as many of us as 
we can to take out the Triad.</b>

22:08.120 --> 22:10.870
<b>This is the end, Dark Triad!</b>

22:27.560 --> 22:30.480
"No" no rakuin o shotta

22:27.560 --> 22:30.480
Bearing the weight of being told "No"

22:30.730 --> 22:34.190
matowaritsuku kono akashi

22:30.730 --> 22:34.190
remains behind as proof.

22:35.480 --> 22:39.490
umaremotta sainode kimerareta

22:35.480 --> 22:39.490
The talent you're born with is decided

22:39.490 --> 22:42.540
kami no itazura.

22:39.490 --> 22:42.540
as a prank by the Gods.

22:43.490 --> 22:47.540
Mada nagai hateshinai tabi ni fukaketsu nano wa kimi

22:43.490 --> 22:47.540
Still further. Endless. What's indispensible on this journey is you.

22:47.540 --> 22:51.290
Tada "gūzen" o matsu yori kono "shūnen" de okosu kiseki.

22:47.540 --> 22:51.290
I'd rather create a miracle with "tenacity" than waiting for "chance".

22:51.290 --> 22:55.170
Kiri no mukō-gawa ni wa sunrise

22:51.290 --> 22:55.170
What exists beyond the fog is the sunrise.

23:03.840 --> 23:06.310
tonari dōshi de ayumi?

23:03.840 --> 23:06.310
Walking side by side

23:12.020 --> 23:13.230
Kimi to boku?

23:12.020 --> 23:13.230
You and I

23:16.030 --> 23:19.360
Atomodori wa mō shinaito

23:16.030 --> 23:19.360
Deciding never to turn back,

23:20.070 --> 23:23.030
kimi to chikai o tateta.

23:20.070 --> 23:23.030
I made a vow with you.

23:24.030 --> 23:27.330
Dake dofurikaereba ashiato

23:24.030 --> 23:27.330
But, when I looked back, the footprints

23:27.330 --> 23:31.170
wa kiezu ni tsudzuite ita.

23:27.330 --> 23:31.170
continued without fading

23:36.460 --> 23:37.630
Kimi to boku

23:36.460 --> 23:37.630
You and I
